204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 518 0 R
/E (This advanced system architecture leverages a Hybrid CNN-LSTM structure enhanced with Transformer-based attention mechanisms for robust sequence and feature learning. Its core capability lies in multi-scale feature integration coupled with advanced preprocessing, relying on key technologies like LibROSA, and the Transformers library for implementation. For Deployment, the system is designed with privacy-preserving local processing to support efficient execution. It prioritizes user experience through user-friendly interfaces and ensures data security via privacy-preserving local processing. The versatile Applications span across several domains, including Healthcare \(mental health monitoring, elderly care\), Education \(adaptive learning, engagement tracking\), Business \(customer service automation, driver safety monitoring\), and HCI \(accessible interfaces, emotion-aware AI systems\).)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
